exit: 1
-- SYNTAX ------------------- errors/syntax_error_8.march

A type's variants are listed without a leading `|`: [syntax_error]

3 |   type Color = | Red | Green
                   ^

    type Color = Red | Green

    fix (`forge fix` applies it):

3 -   type Color = | Red | Green
3 +   type Color = Red | Green

after fix: exit 0
